  entries:
  - line: "The air feels different\u2026 something\u2019s nearby."
    weight: 0
  - line: I sense a spark of power ahead!
    weight: 0
  - line: "Let\u2019s see what fate throws at us this time."
    weight: 0
  - line: "Hope you stretched\u2014this might get messy."
    weight: 0
  - line: Another day, another wild creature to tame!
    weight: 0
  - line: "Even the wind\u2019s holding its breath\u2026"
    weight: 0
  - line: "Don\u2019t blink. The next one could be shiny!"
    weight: 0
  - line: "Stay sharp\u2014luck favors the alert."
    weight: 0
  - line: "I\u2019ve got a feeling about this one."
    weight: 0
  - line: "Every encounter\u2019s a step toward greatness."
    weight: 0
